   "what_it_is": "A subway-tiled walkway tunnel that paints itself tile by tile (floor then walls then ceiling), driven by a pattern-maker console at the mouth. The console's GROUP / MOTIF / PALETTE / SPEED sliders re-skin the whole tube through any of the 17 wallpaper symmetry groups; touching a control surges the f",
